{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22375","headline":"同友人寻涧花 · 白居易","name":"同友人寻涧花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有涧底花，贳得村中酒。\n与君来校迟，已逢摇落後。\n临觞有遗恨，怅望空溪口。\n记取花发时，期君重携手。\n我生日日老，春色年年有。\n且作来岁期，不知身健否。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}